{"book":"mn98","suttas":[{"id":"mn98","title":"Vāseṭṭhasutta","rows":[["mn98:0.1","Majjhima Nikāya 98","","",""],["mn98:0.2","Vāseṭṭhasutta","2. 5. 8. vāseṭṭhasuttaṃ","8. Vāseṭṭhasuttaṃ","vāseṭṭhasuttaṃ"],["mn98:1.1","Evaṁ me sutaṁ—","evaṃ me sutaṃ:","Evaṃ me sutaṃ –","evamme sutaṃ"],["mn98:1.2","ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe.","ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe.","ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe.","ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe."],["mn98:2.1","Tena kho pana samayena sambahulā abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā icchānaṅgale paṭivasanti, seyyathidaṁ—","tena kho pana samayena sambahulā abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsāḷā icchānaṅgale paṭivasanti. seyyathidaṃ:","Tena kho pana samayena sambahulā abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā icchānaṅgale paṭivasanti, seyyathidaṃ –","tena kho pana samayena sambahulā abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā icchānaṅgale paṭivasanti seyyathīdaṃ"],["mn98:2.2","caṅkī brāhmaṇo, tārukkho brāhmaṇo, pokkharasāti brāhmaṇo, jāṇussoṇi brāhmaṇo, todeyyo brāhmaṇo, aññe ca abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā.","caṅkī brāhmaṇo, tārukkho brāhmaṇo, pokkharasāti brāhmaṇo, jāṇussoṇī brāhmaṇo, todeyyo brāhmaṇo, añño ca abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇa mahāsāḷā.","caṅkī brāhmaṇo, tārukkho brāhmaṇo, pokkharasāti brāhmaṇo, jāṇussoṇi brāhmaṇo, todeyyo brāhmaṇo, aññe ca abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā.","caṅkī brāhmaṇo tārukkho brāhmaṇo pokkharasāti brāhmaṇo jāṇussoṇi brāhmaṇo todeyyo brāhmaṇo aññe ca abhiññātā abhiññātā brāhmaṇamahāsālā."],["mn98:3.1","Atha kho vāseṭṭhabhāradvājānaṁ māṇavānaṁ jaṅghāvihāraṁ anucaṅkamantānaṁ anuvicarantānaṁ ayamantarākathā udapādi:","atha kho vāseṭṭhabhāradvājānaṃ māṇavānaṃ jaṅghāvihāraṃ anucaṅkamamānānaṃ anuvicaramānānaṃ ayamantarā kathā udapādi:","Atha kho vāseṭṭhabhāradvājānaṃ māṇavānaṃ jaṅghāvihāraṃ anucaṅkamantānaṃ anuvicarantānaṃ ayamantarākathā udapādi –","atha kho vāseṭṭhabhāradvājānaṃ māṇavānaṃ jaṅghāvihāraṃ anucaṅkamantānaṃ anuvicarantānaṃ ayamantarākathā udapādi"],["mn98:3.2","“kathaṁ, bho, brāhmaṇo hotī”ti?","‘kathamho brāhmaṇo hotī’ti.","‘‘kathaṃ, bho, brāhmaṇo hotī’’ti?","kathambho brāhmaṇo hotīti."],["mn98:3.3","Bhāradvājo māṇavo evamāha:","bhāradvājo māṇavo evamāha:","Bhāradvājo māṇavo evamāha –","bhāradvājo māṇavo evamāha"],["mn98:3.4","“yato kho, bho, ubhato sujāto mātito ca pitito ca saṁsuddhagahaṇiko yāva sattamā pitāmahayugā akkhitto anupakkuṭṭho jātivādena—","yato kho bho ubhato sujāto mātito ca pitito ca, saṃsuddhagahaṇiko yāva sattamā pitāmahayugā akkhitto anupakkuṭṭho jātivādena.","‘‘yato kho, bho, ubhato sujāto mātito ca pitito ca saṃsuddhagahaṇiko yāva sattamā pitāmahayugā akkhitto anupakkuṭṭho jātivādena –","yato kho bho ubhatosujāto hoti mātito ca pitito ca saṃsuddhagahaṇiko yāva sattamā pitāmahayugā akkhitto anupakkuṭṭho jātivādena"],["mn98:3.5","ettāvatā kho, bho, brāhmaṇo hotī”ti.","ettāvatā kho bho, brāhmaṇo hotī’ti.","ettāvatā kho, bho, brāhmaṇo hotī’’ti.","ettāvatā kho bho brāhmaṇo hotīti."],["mn98:3.6","Vāseṭṭho māṇavo evamāha:","vāseṭṭho māṇavo evamāha:","Vāseṭṭho māṇavo evamāha –","vāseṭṭhamāṇavo evamāha"],["mn98:3.7","“yato kho, bho, sīlavā ca hoti vattasampanno ca—","‘yato kho bho, sīlavā ca hoti vattasampanno ca","‘‘yato kho, bho, sīlavā ca hoti vattasampanno ca –","yato kho bho sīlavā ca hoti vattasampanno ca"],["mn98:3.8","ettāvatā kho, bho, brāhmaṇo hotī”ti.","ettāvatā kho bho, brāhmaṇo hotī’ti.","ettāvatā kho, bho, brāhmaṇo hotī’’ti.","ettāvatā kho bho brāhmaṇo hotīti."],["mn98:4.1","Neva kho asakkhi bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhaṁ māṇavaṁ saññāpetuṁ, na pana asakkhi vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṁ māṇavaṁ saññāpetuṁ.","neva kho asakkhi bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhaṃ māṇavaṃ saññāpetuṃ. na pana asakkhi vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṃ māṇavaṃ saññāpetuṃ.","Neva kho asakkhi bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhaṃ māṇavaṃ saññāpetuṃ, na pana asakkhi vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṃ māṇavaṃ saññāpetuṃ.","neva kho asakkhi bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhaṃ māṇavaṃ saññāpetuṃ na panāsakkhi vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṃ māṇavaṃ saññāpetuṃ."],["mn98:5.1","Atha kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṁ māṇavaṁ āmantesi:","atha kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṃ māṇavaṃ āmantesi:","Atha kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṃ māṇavaṃ āmantesi –","atha kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhāradvājaṃ māṇavaṃ āmantesi"],["mn98:5.2","“ayaṁ kho, bho bhāradvāja, samaṇo gotamo sakyaputto sakyakulā pabbajito icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe.","‘ayaṃ kho bho bhāradvāja, samaṇo gotamo sakyaputto sakyakulā pabbajito icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe.","‘‘ayaṃ kho, bho bhāradvāja, samaṇo gotamo sakyaputto sakyakulā pabbajito icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe.","ayaṃ kho bho bhāradvāja samaṇo gotamo sakyaputto sakyakulā pabbajito icchānaṅgale viharati icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe"],["mn98:5.3","Taṁ kho pana bhavantaṁ gotamaṁ evaṁ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato:","taṃ kho pana bhagavantaṃ gotamaṃ evaṃ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato:","Taṃ kho pana bhavantaṃ gotamaṃ evaṃ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato –","taṃ kho pana bhavantaṃ gotamaṃ evaṃkalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato"],["mn98:5.4","‘itipi so bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā’ti.","itipi so bhagavā arahaṃ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṃ buddho bhagavā’ti.","‘itipi so bhagavā arahaṃ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṃ buddho bhagavā’ti.","itipi so bhagavā arahaṃ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṃ buddho bhagavāti"],["mn98:5.5","Āyāma, bho bhāradvāja, yena samaṇo gotamo tenupasaṅkamissāma; upasaṅkamitvā samaṇaṁ gotamaṁ etamatthaṁ pucchissāma.","āyāma bho bhāradvāja, yena samaṇo gotamo tenupasaṅkamissāma. upasaṅkamitvā samaṇaṃ gotamaṃ etamatthaṃ pucchissāma.","Āyāma, bho bhāradvāja, yena samaṇo gotamo tenupasaṅkamissāma; upasaṅkamitvā samaṇaṃ gotamaṃ etamatthaṃ pucchissāma.","āyāma bho bhāradvāja yena samaṇo gotamo tenupasaṅkamissāma upasaṅkamitvā samaṇaṃ gotamaṃ etamatthaṃ pucchissāma"],["mn98:5.6","Yathā no samaṇo gotamo byākarissati tathā naṁ dhāressāmā”ti.","yathā no samaṇo gotamo byākarissati tathā naṃ dhāressāmā’ti.","Yathā no samaṇo gotamo byākarissati tathā naṃ dhāressāmā’’ti.","yathā no samaṇo gotamo byākarissati tathā naṃ dhāressāmāti."],["mn98:5.7","“Evaṁ, bho”ti kho bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhassa māṇavassa paccassosi.","evambhoti kho bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhassa māṇavassa paccassosi.","‘‘Evaṃ, bho’’ti kho bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhassa māṇavassa paccassosi.","evaṃ bhoti kho bhāradvājo māṇavo vāseṭṭhassa māṇavassa paccassosi."],["mn98:6.1","Atha kho vāseṭṭhabhāradvājā māṇavā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodiṁsu.","atha kho vāseṭṭha, bhāradvājā māṇavā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṃsu. upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṃ sammodiṃsu,","Atha kho vāseṭṭhabhāradvājā māṇavā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṃsu; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṃ sammodiṃsu.","atha kho vāseṭṭhabhāradvājamāṇavā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṃsu upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṃ sammodiṃsu"],["mn98:6.2","Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu.","sammodanīyaṃ kathaṃ sārāṇīyaṃ vītisāretvā ekamantaṃ nisīdiṃsu.","Sammodanīyaṃ kathaṃ sāraṇīyaṃ vītisāretvā ekamantaṃ nisīdiṃsu.","sammodanīyaṃ kathaṃ sārāṇīyaṃ vītisāretvā ekamantaṃ nisīdiṃsu."],["mn98:6.3","Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhagavantaṁ gāthāhi ajjhabhāsi:","ekamantaṃ nisinno kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhagavantaṃ gāthāhi ajjhabhāsi:","Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhagavantaṃ gāthāhi ajjhabhāsi –","ekamantaṃ nisinno kho vāseṭṭho māṇavo bhagavantaṃ gāthāhi ajjhabhāsi"],["mn98:7.1","“Anuññātapaṭiññātā,","anuññātapaṭiññātā","‘‘Anuññātapaṭiññātā,","anuññātapaṭiññātā"],["mn98:7.2","tevijjā mayamasmubho;","tevijjā mayamassu bho","tevijjā mayamasmubho;","tevijjā mayamasmubho"],["mn98:7.3","Ahaṁ pokkharasātissa,","ahaṃ pokkharasātissa","Ahaṃ pokkharasātissa,","ahaṃ pokkharasātissa"],["mn98:7.4","tārukkhassāyaṁ māṇavo.","tārukkhassāyaṃ māṇavo.","tārukkhassāyaṃ māṇavo.","tārukkhassāyamāṇavo"],["mn98:7.5","Tevijjānaṁ yadakkhātaṁ,","tevijjānaṃ yadakkhātaṃ","‘‘Tevijjānaṃ yadakkhātaṃ,","tevijjānaṃ yadakkhātaṃ"],["mn98:7.6","tatra kevalinosmase;","tattha kevalino’smase","tatra kevalinosmase;","tatra kevalinosmase"],["mn98:7.7","Padakasmā veyyākaraṇā,","padakasmā veyyākaraṇā","Padakasmā veyyākaraṇā ,","padakasmā no byākaraṇā"],["mn98:7.8","jappe ācariyasādisā;","jappe ācariyasādisā.","jappe ācariyasādisā;","jappe ācariyasādisā"],["mn98:7.9","Tesaṁ no jātivādasmiṁ,","tesaṃ no jātivādasmiṃ","Tesaṃ no jātivādasmiṃ,","tesanno jātivādasmiṃ"],["mn98:7.10","vivādo atthi gotama.","vivādo atthi gotama,","vivādo atthi gotama.","vivādo atthi gotama"],["mn98:7.11","Jātiyā brāhmaṇo hoti,","jātiyā brāhmaṇo hoti","‘‘Jātiyā brāhmaṇo hoti,","jātiyā brāhmaṇo hoti"],["mn98:7.12","bhāradvājo iti bhāsati;","bhāradvājo iti bhāsati","bhāradvājo iti bhāsati;","bhāradvājo iti bhāsati"],["mn98:7.13","Ahañca kammunā brūmi,","ahañca kammanā brūmi","Ahañca kammunā brūmi,","ahañca kammunā brūmi"],["mn98:7.14","evaṁ jānāhi cakkhuma.","evaṃ jānāhi cakkhuma.","evaṃ jānāhi cakkhuma.","evaṃ jānāhi cakkhuma"],["mn98:7.15","Te na sakkoma ñāpetuṁ,","te na sakkoma ñāpetuṃ","‘‘Te na sakkoma ñāpetuṃ ,","tena sakkoma ñāpetuṃ"],["mn98:7.16","aññamaññaṁ mayaṁ ubho;","aññamaññaṃ mayaṃ ubho","aññamaññaṃ mayaṃ ubho;","aññamaññaṃ mayaṃ ubho"],["mn98:7.17","Bhavantaṁ puṭṭhumāgamā,","bhagavantaṃ puṭṭhumāgamma","Bhavantaṃ puṭṭhumāgamā,","bhagavantaṃ puṭṭhuṃ āgamma"],["mn98:7.18","sambuddhaṁ iti vissutaṁ.","sambrūddhaṃ iti vissutaṃ.","sambuddhaṃ iti vissutaṃ.","sambuddhaṃ iti vissutaṃ"],["mn98:7.19","Candaṁ yathā khayātītaṁ,","candaṃ yathā khayātītaṃ","‘‘Candaṃ yathā khayātītaṃ,","candaṃ yathā khayātītaṃ"],["mn98:7.20","pecca pañjalikā janā;","pecca pañjalikā janā","pecca pañjalikā janā;","pecca pañjālikā janā"],[