kkhumanto rūpāni dakkhantī’ti; evamevaṁ bhotā gotamena anekapariyāyena dhammo pakāsito.","seyyathāpi bho gotama, nikkujjitaṃ vā ukkujjeyya, paṭicchannaṃ vā vivareyya, mūḷhassa vā maggaṃ ācikkheyyā. andhakāre vā telapajjotaṃ dhāreyya cakkhumanto rūpāni dakkhintī’ti. evamevaṃ bhotā gotamena anekapariyāyena dhammo pakāsito,","Seyyathāpi, bho gotama, nikkujjitaṃ vā ukkujjeyya, paṭicchannaṃ vā vivareyya, mūḷhassa vā maggaṃ ācikkheyya, andhakāre vā telapajjotaṃ dhāreyya – cakkhumanto rūpāni dakkhantīti – evamevaṃ bhotā gotamena anekapariyāyena dhammo pakāsito.","seyyathāpi bho gotama nikkujjitaṃ vā ukkujjeyya paṭicchannaṃ vā vivareyya mūḷhassa vā maggaṃ ācikkheyya andhakāre vā telapajjotaṃ dhāreyya cakkhumanto rūpāni dakkhantīti evameva bhotā gotamena anekapariyāyena dhammo pakāsito"],["mn98:14.4","Ete mayaṁ bhavantaṁ gotamaṁ saraṇaṁ gacchāma dhammañca bhikkhusaṅghañca.","ete mayaṃ bhavantaṃ gotamaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāma dhammañca bhikkhusaṅghañca.","Ete mayaṃ bhavantaṃ gotamaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāma dhammañca bhikkhusaṅghañca.","ete mayaṃ bhavantaṃ gotamaṃ saraṇaṃ gacchāma dhammañca bhikkhusaṅghañca"],["mn98:14.5","Upāsake no bhavaṁ gotamo dhāretu ajjatagge pāṇupetaṁ saraṇaṁ gate”ti.","upāsake no bhavaṃ gotamo dhāretu ajjatagge pāṇupetaṃ saraṇaṃ gateti.","Upāsake no bhavaṃ gotamo dhāretu ajjatagge pāṇupetaṃ saraṇaṃ gate’’ti.","upāsake no bhavaṃ gotamo dhāretu ajjatagge pāṇupete saraṇaṅgateti."],["mn98:14.6","Vāseṭṭhasuttaṁ niṭṭhitaṁ aṭṭhamaṁ.","vāseṭṭhasuttaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ.","Vāseṭṭhasuttaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ.","vāseṭṭhasuttaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."]],"var":{"ms":{"mn98:1.2":"icchānaṅgale → icchānaṅkale (cck: sī. pī.) | icchānaṅgalavanasaṇḍe → icchānaṅgālavaṇasaṇḍe (sya-all: sī.)","mn98:2.1":"brāhmaṇamahāsālā → brāhmaṇamahāsāḷā (bj)","mn98:2.2":"jāṇussoṇi → jāṇussoṇī (bj) | aññe → añño (bj) | brāhmaṇamahāsālā → brāhmaṇa mahāsāḷā (bj) | jāṇussoṇi → jāṇussoṇī (cck: pī.); jāṇusoṇī (cck: ka.)","mn98:3.1":"anuvicaramānānaṁ → anucaṅkamantānaṁ anuvicarantānaṁ (bj: machasaṁ, syā) | anuvicarantāna